<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>New {{role}} Registration</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f3f4f6;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .email-wrapper {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #e23744;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h2 {
      margin: 0;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 20px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .body {
      padding: 32px 24px;
      color: #374151;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .body p {
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .details-box {
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-left: 4px solid #e23744;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .detail-row {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .detail-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #6b7280;
      display: inline-block;
      width: 110px;
    }
    .detail-value {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #111827;
    }
    .capitalize {
      text-transform: capitalize;
    }
    .btn-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #111827;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background-color: #1f2937;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      color: #9ca3af;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Action Required: Verify New <span class="capitalize">{{role}}</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi Admin,</p>
      <p>A new user has just registered on the platform and requires your verification before they can start fulfilling orders. Please review their submitted details below:</p>
      
      <div class="details-box">
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Name:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{name}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Email:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{email}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Role:</span>
          <span class="detail-value capitalize">{{role}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Registered:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{createdAt}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>Prompt verification ensures our new riders and sellers can get onboarded and active as quickly as possible.</p>
      
      <div class="btn-container">
        <a href="{{adminDashboardUrl}}" class="btn">Review Profile</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated system notification. Please do not reply directly to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>